          "title": "You'll want to know: கதைசொல்லி",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கதைசொல்லி — kataicolli — \"a storyteller\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அந்தக் கதைசொல்லி குழந்தைகளைச் சிரிக்க வைத்தார். antak kataicolli kuḻantaikaḷaic cirikka vaittār. That storyteller made the children laugh."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கதை + சொல்லி, one who tells."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கதைசொல்லி (kataicolli) joins கதை, \"story\", from Sanskrit kathā (CDIAL 2704), with சொல்லி, \"one who tells\", from native சொல் (DEDR 2855)."
            }
          ]
        },
